            "review_text": "Jayandtara\n3 contributions\n0\nWorst bar on beer street\nMay 2025 • Family\nLiterally just sat down and the spirits are watered down and the Coca Cola warm……..only bad I’ve had this on in beer street avoid like the plague. Complained and told the ice was in whisky so watered it down yet they can’t produce a cold soft drink. Con artists, glad it was the first drink and it wasn’t after a few.\nInsider tip:\nDon’t water down drinks\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 24, 2025",
