            "review_text": "Monica Khosla\n5 contributions\n0\nAWFUL EXPERIENCE. Fake reviews\nJun 2024 • Family\nAlmost an hour back we came back from blues bar with utmost disappointment as everything was horrible. We went to blues bar as it’s been highly rated but I think these are bought reviews. In the whole buzzing street “blues bar” was completely empty with just one table occupied but we still went ahead trusting the reviews and ordered 3 dishes. All of them were really bad and we noticed that the server was getting the food from some distant local stall as their own chef wasn’t available. We wouldn’t have mind it had the taste been fresh and good. Chicken was super chewy. Wonder how can one go wrong with French fries as they were soggy and tasteless. Cherry on the cake was Vietnamese worldwide famous dish BAHN MI which again they ruined it to the core. Got it super cold not baked and awful presentation.alcohol was highly priced in comparison to other bars with stone throw distance.\nSo far we have had real good food in Vietnam but BLUES BAR RUINED our experience.\nRead more\nWritten June 5, 2024",
