            "review_text": "Frances H\n11 contributions\n0\nWarning\nJun 2023 • Couples\nJust a word of warning to any tourists that may go to this pub, we ordered drinks and the server asked for payment up front. Shortly after this she returned to us asking if we were with another group that had also been in the pub and I informed her we were not. It appeared she was looking for them to pay their bill. She then did not return with our drink and after a period of time I went to the bar myself and asked her if we could have our drinks and our change, she then tried to tell me that my 'husband' had drank the two drinks!!! I informed her that he had not as we had not received any drinks and I had to inform the staff behind the bar who apologised and provided me with my drinks and change in the end. Absolutely shocking way to be treated by this server.\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2023",
